# Three things the harness itself produces in this directory and which must not be
# committed.  trusted_configs is the TRUSTED_CONFIG_LIST the build is pointed at,
# whose location test/README recommends be exactly here; it holds an absolute path
# to the checkout it was generated in.  missingfile is created by test 2600, which
# asks for a lookup against a deliberately absent database file named in this
# directory.  tmp/ is a second spool directory, named by test 0910's configuration,
# and holds spool files just as spool/ above does.
trusted_configs
missingfile
tmp/
